# Media: videos up to 10 MB are committed. Every file over 10 MB and every .mov under examples/
# is an asset of this repository's media release, listed in examples/MEDIA.json and
# excluded by the managed block at the end (python scripts/publish_media.py --refresh).
*.mp4
!examples/**/*.mp4

